        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": "Talk to James for:\r\n\r\n- A grumpy old man who sits outside of his home smoking a Mellow Weed for his bad hip.\r\n- Will buy Mellow Weed from players if they have it in their inventory.\r\n- Once Mellow Weed has been sold to him, he will talk about how he used to fish when he was younger, but now he can't get 10 feet without his hip buckling. After this, he will begin to sell his old fishing stuff to players who have sold him Mellow Weed."
        }
      }
